tyle=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(57, 58, 52); color: rgb(57, 58, 52); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14.4px; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;their software license is invalidated on day 15 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token-line&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(57, 58, 52); color: rgb(57, 58, 52); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14.4px; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;and their email address is added to a block list. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token-line&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(57, 58, 52); color: rgb(57, 58, 52); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14.4px; white-space: pre; background-color: rgb(248, 249, 250); text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token plain&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;If the customer accepts the quote, and payment is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;token-line&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(57, 58, 52); color: rgb(57, 58, 52); font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Fira Code&amp;quot;, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14.4px; white-space: pre; background-